ux. <strong>Arch Wiki</strong> contains brief information about many software packages which can run in Arch Linux, with their alternatives.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Conclusion:-</h2>\r\nIn conclusion, switch to Arch Linux now if you want to get more <strong>control</strong> and more <strong>customization</strong> from your OS. You will get more<strong> in-depth knowledge</strong> about the working of your PC, with a <strong>great community</strong> of users and a large software repository. And also, not to mention, <strong>Arch Wiki</strong> to get more info on getting stuff work in Arch Linux with <strong>Rolling Release</strong> feature.', 'Top 6 reasons for switching to Arch Linux', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '41-revision-v1', '', '', '2017-10-22 21:42:44', '2017-10-22 16:12:44', '', 41, 'http://techwinky.com/41-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
