get confused. So, using 2-3 colors simplifies things for the visitor. You may use varieties of shades of that same color. But as usual, don\'t overdo it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-large-font-size\"><u>Conclusion</u>:-</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">Use at most 2-3 colors for your website. It simplifies stuff for the visitor and gives a clean look to your great website.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Quantity of Colors to use in a website', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '120-revision-v1', '', '', '2019-03-01 14:22:01', '2019-03-01 08:52:01', '', 120, 'http://techwinky.com/120-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
